  "steps": [
    "Blend this all into a smooth mixture (the consistency should be like a normal cake batter and not watery, you can add more milk/oatflour to adjust consistency) and pour into an oven safe dish which is greased properly.",
    "Add 1 square dark chocolate in the middle.",
    "Bake in a preheated oven for 18-20 mins at 180C or in the airfryer for 10-12 mins at 170-180C. Please check once in between and you may bake for lesser/more time accordingly.",
    "Let the oats rest for 5 mins under the fan before you dig in.",
    "I have drizzled some chocolate peanut butter on top but you can also add mashed strawberries which will taste juicier.",
